*Note: This macromodel derived from data sheets and pspice models obtained from Philips Semiconductor.

.SUBCKT BAS116 10 30
D1 10 20 DIDEAL
D2 10 20 DRECOMB
D3 20 30 DHIGH

* Subcircuit models
.MODEL DIDEAL D
+(
+  IS =  8.0584E-16
+  N =  1.0246
